WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.483
A2.1 · From chat to agent

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.910
An agent has a goal, tools, a loop and permissions.

3
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:13.568
It calls a tool, reads the result, decides the next step, and repeats.

4
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:21.044
An agent with read-only tools can give a wrong answer, which you can check.

5
00:00:21.094 --> 00:00:25.408
An agent that writes needs the same controls as a person who can.

6
